MongoDB Atlas connection)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Result:** PASS ✅ — 100% of measured endpoints meet the p95 ≤ 500ms threshold"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Performance Benchmark Summary:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  \\"target_p95_ms\\": 500.0,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  \\"samples_per_endpoint\\": 20,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  \\"endpoints\\": {"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"catalog_list\\":    { \\"p50_ms\\": 51.06,  \\"p95_ms\\": 78.67,  \\"max_ms\\": 105.67 },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"catalog_filter\\":  { \\"p50_ms\\": 34.94,  \\"p95_ms\\": 49.58,  \\"max_ms\\": 290.41 },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"recommendations\\": { \\"p50_ms\\": 49.04,  \\"p95_ms\\": 52.03,  \\"max_ms\\": 61.00  },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"cart_read\\":       { \\"p50_ms\\": 93.74,  \\"p95_ms\\": 121.65, \\"max_ms\\": 146.29 },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"cart_add\\":        { \\"p50_ms\\": 421.25, \\"p95_ms\\": 470.82, \\"max_ms\\": 474.47 },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"checkout\\":        { \\"p50_ms\\": 266.89, \\"p95_ms\\": 295.59, \\"max_ms\\": 303.29 },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    \\"orders_list\\":     { \\"p50_ms\\": 70.93,  \\"p95_ms\\": 113.00, \\"max_ms\\": 124.70 }"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  },"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  \\"passed\\": true,"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  \\"over_target\\": {}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Verification Details:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- All critical user-facing endpoints (catalog browsing, filtering, recommendation generation, cart operations, checkout processing, order listing) sustained sub-500ms p95 latencies against MongoDB Atlas."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Recommendation scoring engine p95 was **52.03 ms**, well within the 500ms threshold."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Checkout flow end-to-end p95 was **295.59 ms**."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Benchmark artifact saved to `docs/evidence/KAN-84/api-performance.log`."}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Command:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`python manage.py measure_api_performance --samples 20 --max-p95-ms 500`"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Commit:** `c9ddae7`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Date:** 2026-11-18"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Artifact: docs/evidence/EVIDENCE_INDEX.md"}]}]},"updateAuthor":{"self":"https://prin173projectmanagement.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Aaff688ec-0c21-472a-9e6c-a5f6345d3230","accountId":"712020:aff688ec-0c21-472a-9e6c-a5f6345d3230","emailAddress":"duclayan2420969@mkt.ceu.edu.ph","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/60537dd67b9b42b07231d05ee3faf7f7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSD-6.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/60537dd67b9b42b07231d05ee3faf7f7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSD-6.png","16