al with green checks"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Verification Details:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **Django Backend:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Starts cleanly via `python manage.py runserver`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - System checks pass with 0 errors (`python manage.py check`)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Server endpoints active:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - Public Catalog API: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/catalog/`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - Swagger API Docs: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/docs/`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    - Health Probe: `http://127.0.0.1:8000/health/`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **React Frontend:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Build succeeds with 0 errors: `npm run build` (`npx vite build` -> 110 modules transformed, 414ms)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Vite server configured for port 8443 (`npm run dev`)"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **Staging Host Deployment:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Local staging server runner `backend/scripts/local_staging_server.mjs` reverse-proxies frontend static assets (`frontend/dist`) and routes API traffic (`/api/`, `/catalog/`, `/cart/`, `/orders/`, `/outfits/`, `/media/`) to the Django backend."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - TLS local CA support via mkcert per SRS §5.3."}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Files:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `backend/scripts/local_staging_server.mjs`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `backend/fitfusion/se