integration active and verified"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Integration Verification Details:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **Production Build:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - `npm run build` generates optimized distribution bundles in `frontend/dist/` (0 compilation errors, assets minified and gzipped)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **CORS & CSRF Alignment:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - `corsheaders` installed and registered in `MIDDLEWARE`."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Allowed origins configured in `backend/fitfusion/settings.py` for port 8443 (`http://localhost:8443`, `https://localhost:8443`, `http://127.0.0.1:8443`, `https://127.0.0.1:8443`)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - `CORS_ALLOW_CREDENTIALS = True` enabled for authorization headers and cookies."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - `CSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS` mapped to port 8443 localhost and loopback."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **Frontend API Client:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - `frontend/src/services/api.js` connects to backend REST endpoints for auth, catalog, presets, try-on, cart, checkout, ratings, and recommendations."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Same-origin media proxy configured in `frontend/vite.config.js` and `backend/scripts/local_staging_server.mjs` for `/media/` paths to avoid canvas tainting during virtual try-on."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- **TLS Configuration:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"  - Optional local CA (mkcert) auto-detected at `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\\\FitFusionAI\\\\certs\\\\` or standard loopback fallback per SRS §5.3."}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Files:**"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `backend/fitfusion/settings.py`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `backend/scripts/local_staging_server.mjs`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `frontend/vite.config.js`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- `frontend/src/services/api.js`"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Commit:** `c9ddae7`"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Date:** 2026-11-18"}]},{"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"- Artifact: docs/evidence/EVIDENCE_INDEX.md"}]}]},"updateAuthor":{"self":"https://prin173projectmanagement.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=712020%3Aaff688ec-0c21-472a-9e6c-a5f6345d3230","accountId":"712020:aff688ec-0c21-472a-9e6c-a5f6345d3230","emailAddress":"duclayan2420969@mkt.ceu.edu.ph","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/60537dd67b9b42b07231d05ee3faf7f7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSD-6.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/60537dd67b9b42b07231d05ee3faf7f7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSD-6.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/60537dd67b9b42b07231d05ee3faf7f7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSD-6.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/60537dd67b9b42b07231d05ee3faf7f7?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FSD-6.png"},"displayName":"SETH MARTIN DUCLAYAN","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Manila","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-11-18T16:16:41.499+0800","updated":"2026-11-18T16:16:41.499+0800","jsdPublic":true}'
